<description>&lt;p&gt;Mozambique security forces are enforcing a December deadline for civilians to surrender illegal firearms while insurgents killed another member of the Anamola group. Militants released fishermen they had been holding captive. Rwanda warned it will pull its troops from Mozambique unless sustainable funding is provided, pressuring the joint counter-insurgency effort. The insurgency caused 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP. A foreign citizen was beaten to death during a march in South Africa amid anti-immigrant tensions linked to regional instability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxOMzliQzBUM28wQUZzVTRsVGhlTmU2amJ0MFp3N2hCQVFybVRtUHBSSmNCVXM1M1QyRkFwRkY3SVNUcjFjbGs2Q09lYnVpaTAzRlpfTURITGdMaWtRNGt6dmZMODNPdTNtY0dYY01OM294Z3RWYUxfNDRRbkdnODlLVmFn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dailysports&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPVDNDdllDR1V4bFphWFhHM2xHSG8tTjBIdWswcmV0RVhrY0xEWV93cEdrVDR0ZjFkSU5zd0xJMTEySmZBV2NXS2ZHRDY0MVQyc2k3ejhRZFp1OFczcmE1cG9ubVQtNFVibmF6UzJaVmVsd3BpYmVYMU94OHhwQlVTY1d4NXo2UE5DSkVyMDdR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Club of Mozambique&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;thecanadianpressnews.ca&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxOaEhlbHlseWtsNFg1b1FNeG5pTExsVHpzbXBZNkhPYjJ2UzNoeHVfYTBnTEh0YWp1NmlBMW1qM1p3ZVZBSnZKNHFSODI5ZVRPa3ZfMEp1Z0tudFFVZkd3d2VWRG14SEhOSlE5eTFYVUJXeHFESjFzdlBJblNWN3pHWUQ4aTBDZTNFWkpEeDQ0R1k3dU1JbTZOSFM5dlRqZkZUNndMeXpLVGsycjdtOGNqaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Club of Mozambique&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE5OZEhuWmpCWWlzUXBMQ0pPeXpaNkYxY21hajdDOVlTdnh0ZktsS2dNM3FzcGFGQUdsZWx2Ni01dlRHU2gxZlRGQnFXVTlMXy1tc1RCV3FfdWZ4ZXJYT1M2clhDanZYU1RNMENtM25RS25WRkkwbERfM18xd2JyMHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;aimnews.org&lt;/a&gt;, &